有問題，等等第3點會提到）\n2.吃油麵就一定要加放在眼前的醋跟風味油，結果才晚上7點半左右，店員就突然過來說要把調味料收走（也不是要拿去補因為還剩很多），有的客人的有拿有的沒拿，後來也沒拿回來給我所以搞不太懂操作\n3.用QRCode點餐，裡面有可以免費加新鮮蒜粒和其他客製化的選項，結果上來的麵也沒有剛剛選的那些東西，我後來跟服務生講他才補給我，朋友也選了料但一樣沒附上，但他說懶得講了就算了。前面提到晚來但麵先上的客人似乎是不要某種料，也有選客製化的選項，但一樣沒有被看到，所以這個訂餐系統也是蠻奇怪的？\n4.看了評論發現湯似乎可以續？但店員也沒有告知\n\n除了上述提到的之外，麵是真的好吃😆",null,[0,34]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6866629666675535714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1V1dOdFpIQlBWMHB6V1cxd00xcFZSblJqYTI4elZUSndXVlp0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6866629666675535714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1V1dOdFpIQlBWMHB6V1cxd00xcFZSblJqYTI4elZUSndXVlp0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6866629666675535714/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1V1dOdFpIQlBWMHB6V1cxd00xcFZSblJqYTI4elZUSndXVlp0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6866629666675535714/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1V1dOdFpIQlBWMHB6V1cxd00xcFZSblJqYTI4elZUSndXVlp0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6866629666675535714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1V1dOdFpIQlBWMHB6V1cxd00xcFZSblJqYTI4elZUSndXVlp0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6866629666675535714/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM1V1dOdFpIQlBWMHB6V1cxd00xcFZSblJqYTI4elZUSndXVlp0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,17000,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5WWNtZHBPV0pzWW1wM1pVRnRja28zVTJwWVZtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x6bf880f4b881cc8c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk9YcmdpOWJsYmp3ZUFtcko3U2pYVmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5WWNtZHBPV0pzWW1wM1pVRnRja28zVTJwWVZtYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5WWNtZHBPV0pzWW1wM1pVRnRja28zVTJwWVZtYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZEN